## Dialogue & Voice Cloning

The **Audio** tab handles all spoken words.

1. Click **Extract Dialogue** (if not already done).
2. The system pulls all dialogue lines from your screenplay.

### Assigning Voices

Each character needs a voice.
- **Existing Assets**: If you assigned a voice in the Asset Bible, it will appear here automatically.
- **New Voices**: You can select a preset voice or clone a new one on the fly.

### Generating Speech

1. Click **Generate All Voices**.
2. StoryBook uses ElevenLabs to convert text to speech with high emotional range.
3. Preview the audio clips. You can regenerate specific lines with different "Stability" or "Clarity" settings if they
sound unnatural.

